><c>telling </c><00:00:02.079><c>you </c><00:00:02.082><c>that </c><00:00:02.085><c>we  </c><00:00:02.088><c>had </c><00:00:02.091><c>an </c><00:00:02.094><c>arrival </c><00:00:02.097><c>at </c><00:00:02.100><c>this </c><00:00:02.103><c>particular </c><00:00:02.106><c>time  </c><00:00:02.109><c>instant </c><00:00:02.112><c>does </c><00:00:02.115><c>not </c><00:00:02.118><c>give </c><00:00:02.121><c>you </c><00:00:02.124><c>any  </c><00:00:02.127><c>substantial </c><00:00:02.130><c>or </c><00:00:02.133><c>any </c><00:00:02.136><c>non-trivial  </c><00:00:02.139><c>information </c><00:00:02.142><c>about </c><00:00:02.145><c>the </c><00:00:02.148><c>other </c><00:00:02.151><c>process </c><00:00:02.154><c>and  </c><00:00:02.157><c>the </c><00:00:02.160><c>two </c><00:00:02.163><c>processes </c><00:00:02.166><c>remain </c><00:00:02.169><c>independent  </c><00:00:02.172><c>this </c><00:00:02.175><c>result </c><00:00:02.178><c>is </c><00:00:02.181><c>surprising </c><00:00:02.184><c>in </c><00:00:02.187><c>some </c><00:00:02.190><c>ways  </c><00:00:02.193><c>but </c><00:00:02.196><c>it </c><00:00:02.199><c>is </c><00:00:02.202><c>true </c><00:00:02.205><c>a </c><00:00:02.208><c>mathematical </c><00:00:02.211><c>derivation  </c><00:00:02.214><c>proceeds </c><00:00:02.217><c>a </c><00:00:02.220><c>long </c><00:00:02.223><c>line </c><00:00:02.226><c>that's </c><00:00:02.229><c>a </c><00:00:02.232><c>little  </c><00:00:02.235><c>different </c><00:00:02.238><c>from </c><00:00:02.241><c>the </c><00:00:02.244><c>intuitive </c><00:00:02.247><c>argument  </c><00:00:02.250><c>that </c><00:00:02.253><c>I </c><00:00:02.256><c>just </c><00:00:02.259><c>outlined </c><00:00:02.262><c>and </c><00:00:02.265><c>we </c><00:00:02.268><c>will </c><00:00:02.271><c>not </c><00:00:02.274><c>go  </c><00:00:02.277><c>through </c><00:00:02.280><c>that </c><00:00:02.283><c>derivation </c><00:00:02.286><c>but </c><00:00:02.289><c>it's </c><00:00:02.292><c>a  </c><00:00:02.295><c>useful </c><00:00:02.298